+		   Reporting the caller's own request back as if it had been
+		   granted is therefore wrong, and audibly so - a 16 kHz stream
+		   comes out 2.75x fast, and a mono stream comes out at half
+		   speed because consecutive samples are taken as a left/right
+		   pair. The stock firmware's own emulators drive this node at
